<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="With You Around"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="With You Around (手游《明日方舟》印象曲)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="BANKS"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="album" value="With You Around"/><amll:meta key="album" value="With You Around (手游《明日方舟》印象曲)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="US39N2691777"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1893800074"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3373534451"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="3KCCWIuxFn3ghegQfX2YaL"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001mg3qI05CEqK"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="659161503"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:30.030"><div begin="13.730" end="3:30.030"><p begin="13.730" end="15.930" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.730" end="14.320">Oh</span> <span begin="14.320" end="14.530">on</span> <span begin="14.530" end="14.650">the</span> <span begin="14.750" end="15.930">bound</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 踏上这归途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 踏上這歸途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 帰路について</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아아 귀로에 올라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh sur le chemin du retour</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah de regreso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach auf dem Heimweg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah neste caminho de volta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Oh sulla via del ritorno</span></p><p begin="17.770" end="21.570" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.770" end="18.410">so</span><span begin="18.410" end="18.550">ber</span> <span begin="18.550" end="18.760">and</span> <span begin="18.760" end="19.430">down</span> <span begin="19.540" end="20.350">my</span> <span begin="20.350" end="20.600">hear</span><span begin="20.600" end="20.720">t</span> <span begin="20.820" end="21.570">holds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清醒而低落 我的心仍在坚守</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">清醒而低落 我的心仍在堅守</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">冷静に 沈む心を抱きしめる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">차분하게 가라앉은 마음을 다잡아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Lucide et abattue mon cœur s&apos;accroche</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">sobria y decaída mi corazón resiste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Klar und bedrückt hält mein Herz stand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sóbria e abatida meu coração resiste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Sobria e malinconica il mio cuore resiste</span></p><p begin="26.930" end="29.380" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.930" end="27.520">Cir</span><span begin="27.520" end="27.590">c</span><span begin="27.590" end="27.740">ling</span> <span begin="27.740" end="27.930">a</span><span begin="27.930" end="29.320">roun</span><span begin="29.320" end="29.380">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">兜兜轉轉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ぐるぐると巡り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">주위를 맴돌아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tournant en rond</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dando vueltas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Immer im Kreis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Andando em círculos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Girando in tondo</span></p><p begin="31.190" end="35.600" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.190" end="31.760">Our</span> <span begin="31.760" end="31.880">lit</span><span begin="31.880" end="32.060">tle</span> <span begin="32.060" end="32.530">town,</span> <span begin="32.530" end="32.590">i</span><span begin="32.590" end="32.710">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="32.710" end="33.340">our</span> <span begin="33.600" end="35.600">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这座小镇 是我们的归宿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這座小鎮 是我們的歸宿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちの小さな街 それが私たちの居場所</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 작은 마을, 그곳이 우리의 안식처야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre petite ville c&apos;est notre foyer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestra pequeña ciudad, es nuestro hogar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere kleine Stadt sie ist unser Zuhause</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nossa pequena cidade, é o nosso lar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">La nostra piccola città è la nostra casa</span></p><p begin="41.390" end="43.970" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.390" end="41.590">And</span> <span begin="41.590" end="41.720">there</span><span begin="41.720" end="41.800">&apos;s</span> <span begin="41.800" end="42.220">some</span><span begin="42.220" end="42.440">thing</span> <span begin="42.440" end="42.630">&apos;bout</span> <span begin="42.630" end="42.710">the</span> <span begin="42.710" end="42.920">c</span><span begin="42.920" end="43.080">i</span><span begin="43.080" end="43.250">ty</span> <span begin="43.250" end="43.620">ligh</span><span begin="43.850" end="43.970">ts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">城市的灯火 总是惹人遐思</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">城市的燈火 總是惹人遐思</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">街の灯りには特別な何かがある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">도시의 불빛에는 무언가 특별한 게 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il y a quelque chose dans les lumières de la ville</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y hay algo sobre las luces de la ciudad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die Lichter der Stadt haben etwas Besonderes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tem algo nas luzes da cidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">E c&apos;è qualcosa nelle luci della città</span></p><p begin="44.730" end="47.790" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.730" end="44.950">Been</span> <span begin="44.950" end="45.170">a</span> <span begin="45.170" end="45.430">long</span> <span begin="45.550" end="45.860">time</span> <span begin="45.990" end="46.240">co</span><span begin="46.390" end="46.570">ming</span> <span begin="46.570" end="46.860">to</span> <span begin="46.860" end="47.240">re</span><span begin="47.240" end="47.460">a</span><span begin="47.460" end="47.740">li</span><span begin="47.740" end="47.790">ze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历经漫长岁月 才终于恍然明了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">歷經漫長歲月 才終於恍然明瞭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">気づくまでに長い時間がかかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨닫기까지 참 오랜 시간이 걸렸어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il a fallu si longtemps pour s&apos;en rendre compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ha pasado mucho tiempo para darme cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es hat lange gedauert bis ich es erkannte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levou muito tempo até eu perceber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ci è voluto tanto tempo per capirlo</span></p><p begin="48.060" end="50.520" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.060" end="48.270">I</span> <span begin="48.270" end="48.510">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="48.510" end="48.840">know</span> <span begin="48.840" end="48.970">i</span><span begin="48.970" end="49.090">f</span> <span begin="49.090" end="49.200">I</span> <span begin="49.200" end="49.440">should</span> <span begin="49.440" end="49.940">say</span> <span begin="49.940" end="50.310">thi</span><span begin="50.310" end="50.520">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知我是否该 将此诉诸于口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不知我是否該 將此訴諸於口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これを言うべきか分からない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 말을 해도 될지 모르겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais pas si je devrais le dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sé si debería decir esto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich weiß nicht ob ich das sagen sollte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sei se eu deveria dizer isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Non so se dovrei dirlo</span></p><p begin="51.360" end="55.960" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.360" end="51.480">Cau</span><span begin="51.480" end="51.580">se</span> <span begin="51.580" end="51.890">I</span> <span begin="51.890" end="52.280">real</span><span begin="52.280" end="52.670">ly</span> <span begin="52.670" end="53.070">want</span> <span begin="53.070" end="53.290">to</span> <span begin="53.290" end="53.390">be</span> <span begin="53.390" end="53.530">s</span><span begin="53.530" end="55.960">trong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我只愿 展现坚强的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我只願 展現堅強的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だって本当は強くありたいから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 정말 강한 사람이고 싶으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Car je veux vraiment être forte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque de verdad quiero ser fuerte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn ich will wirklich stark sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque eu realmente quero ser forte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Perché voglio davvero essere forte</span></p><p begin="57.020" end="1:02.900" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.020" end="57.430">Li</span><span begin="57.430" end="57.590">fe</span> <span begin="57.590" end="57.710">i</span><span begin="57.710" end="57.870">s</span> <span begin="57.870" end="58.370">bet</span><span begin="58.370" end="58.700">ter</span> <span begin="58.700" end="59.440">wi</span><span begin="59.440" end="59.520">th</span> <span begin="59.520" end="59.890">you</span> <span begin="1:00.150" end="1:00.370">a</span><span begin="1:00.370" end="1:02.900">round</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有你在身旁 这人生才更美好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">有你在身旁 這人生才更美好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あなたが側にいてくれる人生の方がいい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 곁에 있는 삶이 더 나아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vie est plus belle quand tu es là</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La vida es mejor contigo cerca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Leben ist besser mit dir an meiner Seite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A vida é melhor com você por perto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">La vita è migliore con te accanto</span></p><p begin="1:05.730" end="1:08.320" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.730" end="1:05.960">Af</span><span begin="1:05.960" end="1:06.260">ter</span> <span begin="1:06.260" end="1:06.440">e</span><span begin="1:06.440" end="1:06.560">ve</span><span begin="1:06.560" end="1:06.740">ry</span><span begin="1:06.860" end="1:07.090">thing</span> <span begin="1:07.090" end="1:07.220">you</span> <span begin="1:07.350" end="1:07.780">ga</span><span begin="1:07.780" end="1:07.880">ve</span> <span begin="1:07.980" end="1:08.320">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你赋予我了一切之后</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在你賦予我了一切之後</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あなたが全てをくれたのに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 내게 모든 걸 주었는데도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Après tout ce que tu m&apos;as donné</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Después de todo lo que me diste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach allem was du mir gegeben hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Depois de tudo que você me deu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Dopo tutto quello che mi hai dato</span></p><p begin="1:08.970" end="1:09.920" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.970" end="1:09.500">Ba</span><span begin="1:09.630" end="1:09.920">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">親愛的</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ねえ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그대여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Bébé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cariño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mein Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu bem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Tesoro</span></p><p begin="1:10.340" end="1:12.440" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.340" end="1:10.520">I</span> <span begin="1:10.520" end="1:10.660">s</span><span begin="1:10.660" end="1:10.810">till</span> <span begin="1:10.910" end="1:11.110">play</span><span begin="1:11.110" end="1:11.180">ed</span> <span begin="1:11.180" end="1:11.460">hide</span> <span begin="1:11.460" end="1:11.880">and</span> <span begin="1:11.880" end="1:12.360">see</span><span begin="1:12.360" end="1:12.440">k</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却仍在与你 玩着捉迷藏</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我卻仍在與你 玩著捉迷藏</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私はまだ かくれんぼをしていた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 여전히 숨바꼭질만 하고 있었지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je jouais encore à cache-cache</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Yo aún jugaba a las escondidas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Habe ich immer noch Verstecken gespielt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu ainda brincava de esconde-esconde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Giocavo ancora a nascondino</span></p><p begin="1:12.440" end="1:14.950" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.440" end="1:12.610">Woul</span><span begin="1:12.610" end="1:12.740">dn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:12.850" end="1:13.110">blame</span> <span begin="1:13.300" end="1:13.530">you</span> <span begin="1:13.530" end="1:13.650">i</span><span begin="1:13.650" end="1:13.730">f</span> <span begin="1:13.730" end="1:13.890">you</span> <span begin="1:14.030" end="1:14.530">hate</span> <span begin="1:14.680" end="1:14.950">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若你怨恨我 我也毫无怨言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倘若你怨恨我 我也毫無怨言</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を憎んだとしても 責めたりしない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 날 미워해도 탓하지 않을 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne t&apos;en voudrais pas si tu me détestais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No te culparía si me odias</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Würde es dir nicht verübeln wenn du mich hasst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não te culparia se você me odiasse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Non ti biasimerei se mi odiassi</span></p><p begin="1:15.570" end="1:16.590" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.570" end="1:16.090">May</span><span begin="1:16.330" end="1:16.590">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">或許吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もしかしたら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어쩌면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Peut-être</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tal vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vielleicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Talvez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Forse</span></p><p begin="1:17.000" end="1:19.110" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.000" end="1:17.420">Soon</span> <span begin="1:17.420" end="1:17.670">you</span> <span begin="1:17.670" end="1:17.920">and</span> <span begin="1:17.920" end="1:18.050">I</span> <span begin="1:18.160" end="1:18.510">could</span> <span begin="1:18.680" end="1:19.080">mee</span><span begin="1:19.080" end="1:19.110">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不久后 你我便能重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不久後 你我便能重逢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すぐに私たち 会えるかもしれない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">머지않아 우리가 다시 만날지도 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que bientôt toi et moi pourrions nous retrouver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pronto tú y yo podríamos encontrarnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Könnten du und ich uns bald treffen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Logo você e eu poderíamos nos encontrar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Presto potremmo rivederci</span></p><p begin="1:19.110" end="1:21.630" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.110" end="1:19.330">I</span> <span begin="1:19.330" end="1:19.420">would</span> <span begin="1:19.530" end="1:19.800">tell</span> <span begin="1:19.930" end="1:20.110">you</span> <span begin="1:20.110" end="1:20.310">t