ion" xml:lang="fr">Il a fallu si longtemps pour s&apos;en rendre compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ha pasado mucho tiempo para darme cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es hat lange gedauert bis ich es erkannte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levou muito tempo até eu perceber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ci è voluto tanto tempo per capirlo</span></p><p begin="2:08.070" end="2:11.550" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.070" end="2:08.280">I</span> <span begin="2:08.280" end="2:08.520">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:08.520" end="2:08.860">know</span> <span begin="2:08.860" end="2:08.980">i</span><span begin="2:08.980" end="2:09.140">f</span> <span begin="2:09.140" end="2:09.240">I</span> <span begin="2:09.240" end="2:09.490">should</span> <span begin="2:09.490" end="2:10.000">say</span> <span begin="2:10.000" end="2:10.330">this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知我是否该 将此诉诸于口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不知我是否該 將此訴諸於口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これを言うべきか分からない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 말을 해도 될지 모르겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais pas si je devrais le dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sé si debería decir esto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich weiß nicht ob ich das sagen sollte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sei se eu deveria dizer isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Non so se dovrei dirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:09.750" end="2:11.550"><span begin="2:09.750" end="2:09.970">(I</span> <span begin="2:09.970" end="2:10.190">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:10.190" end="2:10.580">know</span> <span begin="2:10.580" end="2:10.700">i</span><span begin="2:10.700" end="2:10.790">f</span> <span begin="2:10.790" end="2:10.930">I</span> <span begin="2:1