translation" xml:lang="de">Ist es wirklich so</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É mesmo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">È davvero così</span></p><p begin="3:03.210" end="3:05.470" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.210" end="3:03.330">I</span><span begin="3:03.330" end="3:03.390">s</span> <span begin="3:03.390" end="3:03.640">it</span> <span begin="3:03.640" end="3:03.990">real</span><span begin="3:03.990" end="3:04.270">ly</span> <span begin="3:04.440" end="3:04.770">wan</span><span begin="3:04.770" end="3:05.030">t</span> <span begin="3:05.030" end="3:05.470">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你真的还需要我吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你真的還需要我嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">本当に私を求めているの？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">정말 나를 원하는 걸까?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Me veux-tu vraiment ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿De verdad me quieres?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Willst du mich wirklich?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você realmente me quer?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Mi vuoi davvero?</span></p><p begin="3:05.850" end="3:07.490" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.850" end="3:06.300">Ay-</span><span begin="3:06.300" end="3:06.680">yeah</span> <span begin="3:06.680" end="3:07.490">ay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 是啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ そう ああ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아 예 아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah-ouais ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ay sí ay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ah-ja ach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah-yeah ah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ah-sì ah</span></p><p begin="3:08.110" end="3:10.870" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.110" end="3:08.280">And</span> <span begin="3:08.280" end="3:08.380">there</span><span begin="3:08.380" end="3:08.480">&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:08.480" end="3:08.790">some</span><span begin="3:08.940" end="3:09.160">thing</span> <span begin="3:09.160" end="3:09.270">&apos;bout</span> <span begin="3:09.270" end="3:09.380">the</span> <span begin="3:09.380" end="3:09.600">c</span><span begin="3:09.600" end="3:09.800">i</span><span begin="3:09.800" end="3:09.990">ty</span> <span begin="3:09.990" end="3:10.320">ligh</span><span begin="3:10.690" end="3:10.870">ts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">城市的灯火 总是惹人遐思</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">城市的燈火 總是惹人遐思</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">街の灯りには特別な何かがある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">도시의 불빛에는 무언가 특별한 게 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il y a quelque chose dans les lumières de la ville</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y hay algo sobre las luces de la ciudad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die Lichter der Stadt haben etwas Besonderes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E tem algo nas luzes da cidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">E c&apos;è qualcosa nelle luci della città</span></p><p begin="3:11.840" end="3:14.790" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.840" end="3:12.120">Long</span> <span begin="3:12.220" end="3:12.520">time</span> <span begin="3:12.680" end="3:13.130">co</span><span begin="3:13.130" end="3:13.320">ming</span> <span begin="3:13.320" end="3:13.530">to</span> <span begin="3:13.530" end="3:13.950">re</span><span begin="3:13.950" end="3:14.200">a</span><span begin="3:14.200" end="3:14.740">li</span><span begin="3:14.740" end="3:14.790">ze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫长岁月后 才终于明了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漫長歲月後 才終於明瞭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">気づくまでに長い時間がかかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨닫기까지 오랜 시간이 걸렸어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il a fallu longtemps pour s&apos;en rendre compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mucho tiempo para darme cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lange gedauert bis ich es erkannte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levou muito tempo até eu perceber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Tanto tempo per capirlo</span></p><p begin="3:14.810" end="3:17.300" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.810" end="3:14.970">I</span> <span begin="3:14.970" end="3:15.240">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:15.240" end="3:15.590">know</span> <span begin="3:15.590" end="3:15.730">i</span><span begin="3:15.730" end="3:15.840">f</span> <span begin="3:15.840" end="3:15.960">I</span> <span begin="3:15.960" end="3:16.040">should</span> <span begin="3:16.140" end="3:16.310">s</span><span begin="3:16.310" end="3:16.680">ay</span> <span begin="3:16.680" end="3:16.960">thi</span><span begin="3:17.180" end="3:17.300">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知我是否该 将此诉诸于口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不知我是否該 將此訴諸於口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これを言うべきか分からない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 말을 해도 될지 모르겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne sais pas si je devrais le dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sé si debería decir esto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich weiß nicht ob ich das sagen sollte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sei se eu deveria dizer isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Non so se dovrei dirlo</span></p><p begin="3:18.080" end="3:22.280" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.080" end="3:18.170">Cau</span><span begin="3:18.170" end="3:18.320">se</span> <span begin="3:18.320" end="3:18.650">I</span> <span begin="3:18.650" end="3:19.000">real</span><span begin="3:19.000" end="3:19.400">ly</span> <span begin="3:19.400" end="3:19.790">want</span> <span begin="3:19.790" end="3:20.010">to</span> <span begin="3:20.010" end="3:20.130">be</span> <span begin="3:20.130" end="3:20.410">s</span><span begin="3:20.410" end="3:22.280">trong</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我只愿 展现坚强的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我只願 展現堅強的模樣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">だって本当は強くありたいから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">난 정말 강한 사람이고 싶으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Car je veux vraiment être forte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque de verdad quiero ser fuerte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn ich will wirklich stark sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque eu realmente quero ser forte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Perché voglio davvero essere forte</span></p><p begin="3:23.810" end="3:30.030" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.810" end="3:24.210">Li</span><span begin="3:24.210" end="3:24.380">fe</span> <span begin="3:24.380" end="3:24.520">i</span><span begin="3:24.520" end="3:24.600">s</span> <span begin="3:24.710" end="3:25.190">bet</span><span begin="3:25.190" end="3:25.570">ter</span> <span begin="3:25.570" end="3:26.110">wi</span><span begin="3:26.230" end="3:26.310">th</span> <span begin="3:26.310" end="3:26.570">you</span> <span begin="3:26.900" end="3:27.050">a</span><span begin="3:27.170" end="3:30.030">round</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有你在身旁 这人生才更美好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">有你在身旁 這人生才更美好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あなたが側にいてくれる人生の方がいい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 곁에 있는 삶이 더 나아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La vie est plus belle quand tu es là</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La vida es mejor contigo cerca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Leben ist besser mit dir an meiner Seite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A vida é melhor com você por perto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">La vita è migliore con te accanto</span></p></div></body></tt>